  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoons packed brown sugar",
    "2 tablespoons ground New Mexico chile powder",
    "7 pounds fresh pork butt roast"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_5VW9YNLCWw0ttLzfp9oL2tVKFs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-1-4x3-10cbadb06884435a977de73428025302.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "If desired, soak the pork butt in a brine solution for at least 4 hours or overnight. There's a recipe for a brine on this site titled 'Basic Brine for Smoking Meat'. You should do this covered and in the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vDrYL-_ohx3GfiFXgSDQ6zY5U_U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-2-4x3-c8d5528cea72428e8e8a50fae46f1565.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor smoker for 200 to 225 degrees F (95 to 110 degrees C). Place a roasting rack in a drip pan. While grill preheats, in a small bowl, combine the brown sugar, chili powder and any additional seasonings to your taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SgNlrqbEAoZlRjOUS31l77wUVBQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-3-4x3-132622652ff2492eb60b4dc970143498.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Apply this liberally to the meat and rub it in with your fingers.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dIqKl317TTWTDkNehvsiFTr3LMw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-4-4x3-7b4935ecd63f4d70ba4df6ecd9e76404.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a roasting rack in a drip pan and lay the meat on the rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QkV_m_7YxZ4J495vUhd7aA10Ntc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-5-4x3-675b730c3d044d8fbde139d7e1036fdb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smoke at 200 to 225°F (95 to 110°C) for 6 to 18 hours, or until internal pork temperature reaches 145°F (63°C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DUN7SxoAEyBvcVC0j66JYRQt7nQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-17932-smoked-pork-butt-ddmfs-step-6-4x3-384aea1923b64e1a8d67e86fe9d1e4ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17932/step_06.webp"
    }
